PLY AS VENDOR</a><div class=\"navbar-menu-wrapper\" style=\"position:relative\"><button class=\"navbar-menu-icon  \" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button><div class=\"navbar-dropdown \"><div class=\"navbar-dropdown-inner\"><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-item-text\">About</span></a><a href=\"/events\"><span class=\"menu-item-text\">Events</span></a><a href=\"/vendors\"><span class=\"menu-item-text\">Vendors</span></a><a href=\"/sponsorship\"><span class=\"menu-item-text\">Sponsorship</span></a><a href=\"/volunteers\"><span class=\"menu-item-text\">Volunteers</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></nav><section class=\"vendors-page-header-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"vendors-page-header\"><span class=\"eyebrow-badge\">VOLUNTEER APPLICATION</span><h1 class=\"section-title\">JOIN OUR TEAM</h1><p class=\"section-subtitle\">Fill out the form below to apply as a volunteer. We&#x27;ll get back to you with available shifts and details.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"padding:4rem 0\"><div class=\"container\"><form class=\"vendor-application-form\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto\" action=\"\" encType=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_REF_1\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_1:0\" value=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;600fab8d1ef40c254749edfc95f4e56678bfc66437&quot;,&quot;bound&quot;:&quot;$@1&quot;}\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_1:1\" value=\"[{&quot;message&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;success&quot;:false}]\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_KEY\" value=\"k23cf1ffb3e8c5a901cfee3338b54b764\"/><div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem\"><h3 class=\"form-section-title\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#666;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-yellow)\">Personal Information</h3><div class=\"form-row\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"full_name\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Full Name *</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"full_name\" required=\"\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"full_name\"/></div><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"email\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Email Address *</label><input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" required=\"\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"email\"/></div></div><div class=\"form-row\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"phone\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Phone Number</label><input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"phone\"/></div><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"t_shirt_size\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">T-Shirt Size (for volunteer shirts)</label><select id=\"t_shirt_size\" name=\"t_shirt_size\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\"><option value=\"\">Select size...</option><option value=\"XS\">XS</option><option value=\"S\">S</option><option value=\"M\">M</option><option value=\"L\">L</option><option value=\"XL\">XL</option><option value=\"XXL\">XXL</option></select></div></div></div><div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem\"><h3 class=\"form-section-title\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#666;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-yellow)\">Volunteer Preferences</h3><div class=\"form-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><label class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Preferred Roles * (Select all that apply)</label><div class=\"checkbox-group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0.75rem\"><label class=\"checkbox-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-yellow)\" name=\"preferred_roles\" value=\"Event Setup Crew\"/><div><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark);display:block\">Event Setup Crew</span><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#666\">Help set up tables, chairs, and decorations (7:00 AM - 10:00 AM)</span></div></label><label class=\"checkbox-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-yellow)\" name=\"preferred_roles\" value=\"Registration Desk\"/><div><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark);display:block\">Registration Desk</span><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#666\">Greet attendees and check tickets (9:00 AM - 1:00 PM or 1:00 PM - 5:00 PM)</span></div></label><label class=\"checkbox-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-yellow)\" name=\"preferred_roles\" value=\"Floor Guides\"/><div><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark);display:block\">Floor Guides</span><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#666\">Assist attendees and ensure smooth flow (10:00 AM - 2:00 PM or 2:00 PM - 6:00 PM)</span></div></label><label class=\"checkbox-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-yellow)\" name=\"preferred_roles\" value=\"Breakdown Crew\"/><div><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark);display:block\">Breakdown Crew</span><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#666\">Help pack up after the event (6:00 PM - 8:00 PM)</span></div></label></div></div><div class=\"form-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><label for=\"availability\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Availability * (Describe when you&#x27;re available)</label><textarea id=\"availability\" name=\"availability\" required=\"\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"e.g., Available on weekends, weekday mornings, specific dates...\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;resize:vertical;transition:border-color 0.2s\"></textarea></div><div class=\"form-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><label for=\"previous_experience\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Previous Volunteer Experience (Optional)</label><textarea id=\"previous_experience\" name=\"previous_experience\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Tell us about any relevant volunteer experience...\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;resize:vertical;transition:border-color 0.2s\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem\"><h3 class=\"form-section-title\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#666;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-yellow)\">Emergency Contact</h3><div class=\"form-row\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem\"><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"emergency_contact_name\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Emergency Contact Name</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"emergency_contact_name\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"emergency_contact_name\"/></div><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"emergency_contact_phone\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Emergency Contact Phone</label><input type=\"tel\" id=\"emergency_contact_phone\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"emergency_contact_phone\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem\"><h3 class=\"form-section-title\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#666;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-yellow)\">Additional Information</h3><div class=\"form-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><label for=\"how_heard_about\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">How did you hear about volunteering?</label><select id=\"how_heard_about\" name=\"how_heard_about\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\"><option value=\"\">Select an option...</option><option value=\"Social Media (Instagram/Facebook)\">Social Media (Instagram/Facebook)</option><option value=\"Friend/Word of Mouth\">Friend/Word of Mouth</option><option value=\"Previous Event\">Previous Event</option><option value=\"Email Newsletter\">Email Newsletter</option><option value=\"Website\">Website</option><option value=\"Other\">Other</option></select></div><div class=\"form-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><label for=\"additional_notes\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Additional Notes (Optional)</label><textarea id=\"additional_notes\" name=\"additional_notes\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Any other information you&#x27;d like to share...\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;resize:vertical;transition:border-color 0.2s\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"form-actions\" style=\"display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;padding-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1)\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"vendors-cta-btn-primary\" style=\"min-width:200px;opacity:1;cursor:pointer\">Submit Application</button><a class=\"vendors-cta-btn-secondary\" href=\"/volunteers\">Cancel</a></div></form></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0vw2ofiizeta4.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[47420,[\\\"/_nex